# This directory is hash-anchored evidence. The repo runs with
# core.autocrlf=true, which would rewrite CRLF->LF on commit and LF->CRLF on
# checkout, so a fresh clone would NOT reproduce the SHA-256 values recorded
# in raw_artifact_hash_verification.csv and cache_hashes.md.
#
# -text disables all end-of-line conversion here, so every committed byte is
# the byte that was hashed. Do not remove.
* -text
